OL,3,GNEWSAOutdoor pool could be sold for    
OL,4,Aretirement housing                     
OL,6,FAn outdoor pool has been recommended to
OL,7,Fbe sold to make way for 25             
OL,8,Fretirement-living apartments.          
OL,10,FTeignbridge District Council said      
OL,11,Fofficers reviewed bids for the         
OL,12,FTeignmouth Lido site, which included   
OL,13,Fproposals to keep the swimming pool and
OL,14,Falternative redevelopment.             
OL,16,FIn a new report following the bid      
OL,17,Fclosure in September, officers have    
OL,18,Frecommended the proposal for retirement
OL,19,Fhousing, subject to planning.          
OL,20,FCouncillors on Teignbridge District    
OL,21,FCouncil's Executive will make the final
OL,22,Fdecision at a meeting on 1 December.   
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
