OL,3,GNEWSAOutdoor pool could be sold for    
OL,4,Aretirement housing                     
OL,6,FThe council said it recognised the     
OL,7,F"strength of public feeling" about the 
OL,8,FLido, with the report acknowledging the
OL,9,Fproposal would result in its loss as a 
OL,10,Fpublic swimming facility.              
